      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer Letter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">                    &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;To,&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Date &lt;/b&gt;: {offer_date}&lt;br&gt;{applicant_name}&lt;br&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">Pune&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dear {applicant_name},&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;With reference to your<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">application and the subsequent interview process, we are pleased to offer you<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">the position of &lt;b&gt;&#8220;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;{&lt;b&gt;job_title&lt;/b&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#8221;&lt;/b&gt; at our organization. Your monthly salary<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">will be&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;{salary}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;,&lt;/b&gt; as mutually agreed upon during the<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">interview.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Your joining date will be {start_date}.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Kindly bring the following documents on your date of joining<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">for completion of the onboarding process:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\"> &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Educational<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">     Certificates (SSC, HSC, Graduation, Diploma/Degree, Post-Graduation)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\"> &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Relieving/Experience<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">     Letters from your last two organizations&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\"> &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Last<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">     3 months&#8217; Salary Slips&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\"> &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;PAN<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">     Card and Aadhar Card&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\"> &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Two<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\">     Passport Size Photographs&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3687 characters\"> &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Bank<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
